{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/256","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/256/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/256/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/256/events","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/256","id":32996424,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzMjk5NjQyNA==","number":256,"title":"Entry point not emitted in watch mode when a dependency chunk name has changed","user":{"login":"lettertwo","id":210630,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDYzMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/210630?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lettertwo","html_url":"https://github.com/lettertwo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lettertwo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lettertwo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lettertwo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lettertwo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lettertwo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lettertwo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lettertwo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lettertwo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lettertwo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1089820,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDg5ODIw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fbca04","default":true,"description":null},{"id":85532086,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NTUzMjA4Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/labels/X5:%20work%20required%20(PR%20/%20Help%20Wanted)","name":"X5: work required (PR / Help Wanted)","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2014-05-07T15:33:33Z","updated_at":"2014-05-08T15:07:39Z","closed_at":"2014-05-08T07:35:22Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"This gist provides a few files for a simple test case:\n\nhttps://gist.github.com/lettertwo/0bc711c39de7cc9ab484\n\nWhen you run the 'watch.js' script (`node watch.js`), the build stats look like:\n\n```\nHash: 83d212874fd40af46a46\nVersion: webpack 1.1.8\nTime: 30ms\n                  Asset  Size  Chunks             Chunk Names\n             A-built.js  3913       0  [emitted]  A\n68e4e64e56db2b8155d5.js   118       1  [emitted]\n```\n\nIf you make a change to `B.js` (such as changing the `console.log` message), you see:\n\n```\nHash: a14bde30c52251a61bf4\nVersion: webpack 1.1.8\nTime: 6ms\n                  Asset  Size  Chunks             Chunk Names\n             A-built.js  3913       0             A\n3d883216a2ef1c66578c.js   118       1  [emitted]\n```\n\nSo the chunk is emitted with a new name (`3d883216a2ef1c66578c.js`) but the entry point (`A-built.js`) is not emitted with that new name compiled in. If you examine `A-built.js` after this change, you can confirm that it is still going to load the previous build's chunk (`68e4e64e56db2b8155d5.js`).\n","closed_by":{"login":"sokra","id":1365881,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU4ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1365881?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra","html_url":"https://github.com/sokra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/